!
! The unspent carry-over into next month, in Trebago (larder_rules.h LR3):
! the exact sum over the categories of max(0, budget - spent), in integer
! minor units, so an overspent category carries nothing and takes nothing
! from the others. A budget below 0 makes the divisor 1 - 1 = 0, which
! refuses the whole answer; a difference or a sum past 64 bits is refused
! too, never wrapped.
trebago carry
  in  budget(n), spent(n)
  out carry
  carry = sum(i, max(0, budget(i) - spent(i))) &
        / (1 - min(1, sum(j, max(0, 0 - budget(j)))))
end
